 "name": "NXE2S1205MC-R13",
 "kind": "power_module",
 "manufacturer": "Murata Power Solutions",
 "title": "NXE2 series: isolated 2 W single-output surface-mount DC-DC converters",
 "source": {
  "document": "KDC_NXE2.E01",
  "revision": "E01, 2024",
  "pages": 13
 },
 "summary": "A family of four 2 W DC-DC converter modules on a small surface-mount iLGA body, each with one output isolated from its input by a transformer built into the FR4 substrate. Inputs are 5 V or 12 V nominal and outputs 5, 12 or 15 V; the NXE2S1205MC takes 12 V and gives 5 V at up to 400 mA. The barrier is tested to 3 kVDC and is UL recognised to UL62368-1 and ANSI/AAMI ES60601-1. The parts are halogen free, MSL 2 and reflow at up to 260 °C; the modules are specified from -40 to 85 °C, with each model's load derated above the temperatures in its derating graph.",
